# Database safety (20)

- No direct production database write connectors in Cursor.
- Prefer read-replica / bounded SELECT tools; require dry-run counts and rollback for any schema plan.
- Migrations go through reviewed PRs and Database Change Guardian — never ad-hoc apply from the agent shell.
- Fail closed on cross-tenant access; keep `org_id` / tenant scope explicit.
